<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7334] MBeans fail to be created for caches with special symbols in names</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7334</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If a cache contains a certain symbols, e.g. an asterisk, its creation will fail due to an exception during MBean creation. This is because of insufficient escaping in the shared MBean registration code in IgniteUtils.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
